        <section class="dk-sec" id="rules" aria-labelledby="rules-h">
          <header class="dk-sec__head"><span class="lbl">G · Rules</span><h2 id="rules-h">Choosing and combining</h2></header>
          <p class="sec__intro">Which control for which value, and the few rules that apply once atoms are put together (DESIGN.md 16.3).</p>
