              <li>Stepped ink opacity (100, 70, 45, 25, 12 %), largest first, at most five parts, a 1px gap between. Each part has a label and a value below.</li>
              <li>State colours are not used: a part is a category, not a status. The values here are specimen data.</li>
            </ul>
