          <p class="sec__intro">The site is the first customer of its own spec. These numbers are read from the repository when the page is built.</p>

          <dl class="dk-facts">
            <div><dt class="lbl">Atoms specified</dt><dd class="data">{atoms.length}</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="lbl">Atoms shown here</dt><dd class="data">{atoms.length - missing.length}</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="lbl">Colour tokens in spec</dt><dd class="data">{conformance.length}</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="lbl">Same in the CSS</dt><dd class="data">{inSync}</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="lbl">Differ from the CSS</dt><dd class="data">{differs.length}</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="lbl">Not in the CSS</dt><dd class="data">{notInCode.length}</dd></div>
